{"4571380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nodes of Jucia", "steam_appid": 4571380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and sign up to help purify the corruption from our teleportation nodes! At first you won't have much, maybe just a sword or a gun to your name. But as you clean out the corruption, you'll gain cash for upgrades, and hone your skills to increase your power. We are legally obligated to warn you about the dangers of gaining DNA and possible mutations, which may have beneficial or harmful effects, but it's nothing you can't handle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/b6a8258921e711a37fca7306164cc057.poster.avif?t=1778608871\" width=600 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/b6a8258921e711a37fca7306164cc057.webm?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/b6a8258921e711a37fca7306164cc057.mp4?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nodes of Jucia is a fluid visceral top down fighter, emphasising skill and technique over spamming. You're rewarded for weaving different weapons and skills together, or just maximise a single strat and brute force it all. You start with a single class of skills, but as the game progresses you can gain more classes, unlocking powerful combos from multiclassing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/d8a89d79f95fbc6ed13d11620c480701.poster.avif?t=1778608871\" width=600 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/d8a89d79f95fbc6ed13d11620c480701.webm?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/d8a89d79f95fbc6ed13d11620c480701.mp4?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just looking for a quick satisfying sparring session with enemies, or trying to find a broken build, this is the game for you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and sign up to help purify the corruption from our teleportation nodes! At first you won't have much, maybe just a sword or a gun to your name. But as you clean out the corruption, you'll gain cash for upgrades, and hone your skills to increase your power. We are legally obligated to warn you about the dangers of gaining DNA and possible mutations, which may have beneficial or harmful effects, but it's nothing you can't handle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/b6a8258921e711a37fca7306164cc057.poster.avif?t=1778608871\" width=600 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/b6a8258921e711a37fca7306164cc057.webm?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/b6a8258921e711a37fca7306164cc057.mp4?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nodes of Jucia is a fluid visceral top down fighter, emphasising skill and technique over spamming. You're rewarded for weaving different weapons and skills together, or just maximise a single strat and brute force it all. You start with a single class of skills, but as the game progresses you can gain more classes, unlocking powerful combos from multiclassing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/d8a89d79f95fbc6ed13d11620c480701.poster.avif?t=1778608871\" width=600 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/d8a89d79f95fbc6ed13d11620c480701.webm?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/extras/d8a89d79f95fbc6ed13d11620c480701.mp4?t=1778608871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just looking for a quick satisfying sparring session with enemies, or trying to find a broken build, this is the game for you.</p>", "short_description": "A challenging but fluid action rogue-lite in which you hack, slash and shoot waves of enemies. Between stages, manage and maximise your resources, spending them to gain skills, equipment, stats, or even mutations, if you're willing to risk the downsides.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/7ce5daecdcbc632569d02b34014d533f8e6f9674/header.jpg?t=1778608871", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/3e2edfe2000b9bfc10da45783f63d04efe787f16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778608871", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571380/3e2edfe2000b9bfc10da45783f63d04efe787f16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778608871", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz, Dual-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 1080+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB